[Music]  mcu boss kevin feige provided us with  two  exciting pieces of news about deadpool  this week feige announced in an  interview at the occasion of the one  division release on disney plus  that the third part similar to the  preceding ones will not cut back on fake  blood and brutality  in addition he confirms that deadpool 3  will again receive an  r rating and that they are currently  writing the script and the screenplay  together with  ryan reynolds many fans should be quite  relieved because in the past it was  often said  that there were no plans for deadpool in  the near future another good news for  all fans of the hilarious mercenary is  that deadpool will henceforth be part of  the  mcu this was previously not the case as  the franchise belonged to 20th century  fox before the disney takeover however  there is one small drop of bitterness  for impatient fans because feige  reiterated that the film will not be  made this year  this is primarily due to ron reynolds  busy schedule which is why release date  prior to 2023 seems  very unrealistic yet that's not the only  thing foggy had to say about the mcu  among other things he confirmed that he  expects another avengers movie to be  released in the future  that's not really surprising after all  marvel delivered the most successful  film of all time with avengers  and game nevertheless popular characters  like iron man and captain america will  of course have to be bit farewell  as others will follow in their footsteps  so what an upcoming avengers movie might  look like is still  up in the air we do hope to find out  more about phase 5 of the  mcu after the second season of the  umbrella academy ended with a great  twist  fans are now eagerly awaiting the new  characters in season 3.  a total of 7 new characters are going to  be introduced in the upcoming season  including justin cornwell as marcus  justin h min as  ben brittany altford as faye and many  others among the members of sparrow  academy there's also the floating cube  whose identity raised questions after  the season finale  by significantly altering the past the  group around luther hargreaves and co  created a new timeline  in which foster father sir reginald  hargreaves chose completely different  children for his academy and created  sparrow academy instead of umbrella  academy  it is not yet clear when exactly the  third season of the netflix series will  be released  but production will definitely start as  early as next month  after all the recent postponements of  theatrical releases it seems that we can  expect high  profile blockbusters on demand in the  near future and not just due to warner's  controversial streaming strategy as  variety reports the same is the case  with a sci-fi adventure  the tomorrow war featuring chris pratt  as amazon has shown great interest in  the 200 million  film and is nearing the conclusion of  negotiations  furthermore netflix and apple have also  apparently offered a deal but amazon  seems to have the lead  the story of the tomorrow war is about a  future world in which humanity is on the  brink of war with aliens  however things aren't quite looking good  for the earthlings so all  efforts are made to recruit legendary  soldiers from the past using time travel  technology the original cinema release  was planned for july 22nd 2021  unfortunately there is currently no  information about a potential streaming  release  we have known for quite some time that  amazon is producing a gigantic lords of  the ring series  what has been communicated very  cautiously since then however  is information concerning the story and  that despite the fact that filming has  already been underway since last fall  the onering.net has now published a bit  of information about the series  is well known that this story is set in  the second age of middle-earth  included in the report is talk of  unlikely heroes falling and rising  kingdoms and the greatest  villain ever to emerge from tolkien's  pen this refers as you can probably  guess  sauron further it is said that the  series will begin in a peaceful age  in which a cast of familia as well as  new characters will oppose the ever  increasing evil and embrace a huge world  around the misty mountains  the elf capital of london the kingdom of  numeron  along us with the furthest reaches of  the map thus assuming the information is  correct we are  indeed dealing with a gigantic story  about the prehistory of the  rings actress morphed clark might very  well be right in her claim that this  series can keep up with marvel in terms  of scope  at any rate all of us are already  looking forward to the upcoming amazon  series and are eagerly anticipating the  end of the year when the giant project  will be available  on amazon prime and that's it for this  week to find more movie news and the  latest trailers check  our brand new website kinochak.com or  easily leave us up on this channel to  get  everything new first  you

